Optional Realistic Passengers (tools/realistic-pax):

The scripts in tools/realistic-pax build a passenger pack from third-party
assets. The pack is not part of the neoOMSI repository or the program's release
files: the launcher downloads it on request from a release of its own.

- Microsoft Rocketbox avatars, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, MIT License
  (https://github.com/microsoft/Microsoft-Rocketbox). The built pack carries
  the license as LICENSE-Rocketbox.md.
- MakeHuman base mesh, targets and system assets, released under CC0 1.0
  Universal by Data Collection AB, Joel Palmius and Jonas Hauquier
  (http://www.makehumancommunity.org). The built pack carries the notice as
  LICENSE-MakeHuman.txt.
- MPFB, the MakeHuman add-on for Blender (GPL-3.0-or-later), runs only inside
  Blender during the build; none of it is included in the pack.

The pack's .hum files are written by the scripts and hold none of OMSI 2's
files, only a few of their numbers (seat height, step, voice, age).
